l worker's build (`lib/command-attach.ts`, `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, `MODE_COMMANDS` went from empty to populated) landing mid-run — which is also why attached counts are non-zero now. Nothing for me to fix; flagged so a later `dist is stale` on this harness is not read as my change.\n./specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/scratch/logs/wN.out:10:- Temp-dir count, exactly as specified: `ls -d \"$TMPDIR\"/advisor-command-routing-* | wc -l` printed `58` before and `58` after `node scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs > /dev/null`. The harness exited `2` with `@spec-kit/system-skill-advisor dist is stale (source content differs from the attested build)`. Still `58` after the vitest run.\n./specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch/logs/w1-T003.out:61:{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794527425742,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd83e38ffeLH4Ot77Rgtkbk7\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d22b6d36002nYvjIyV1qlorkZ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd83e38ffeLH4Ot77Rgtkbk7\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d22b5ce6001C7ZYJsaUaLLEHw\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_2e9b25e8d4eb49629a4cc497\",\"tool\":\"shell\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"d=$(node -e \\\"const {mkdtempSync}=require('node:fs');const {tmpdir}=require('node:os');const {join}=require('node:path');process.stdout.write(mkdtempSync(join(tmpdir(),'ssa-cold-')))\\\")\\necho \\\"DIR=$d\\\"\\nSPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR=\\\"$d\\\" node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_status --workspace-root /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research --format json --no-warm-only; echo \\\"exit=$?\\\"\\necho \\\"---LS---\\\"; ls -la \\\"$d\\\"\\necho \\\"---PS---\\\"; ps eww -o pid=,command= | grep -F \\\"$d\\\" | grep -v grep | cut -c1-160\\nrm -rf \\\"$d\\\"\"},\"output\":\"DIR=/var/folders/3c/zfqcqsts0kn19cgblj82gqhm0000gn/T/ssa-cold-